uis Guillermo y Betania. Berta se extraña y se asusta al pensar que haría Daniela al enterarse de eso. Daniela no se aguanta ella misma de la furia que tiene desde que Luis Guillermo rompió el compromiso con ella." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/69434d180ce26850f68da2c9" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/69434d180ce26850f68da2c9" grandparentRatingKey="69434d180ce26850f68da2c9" grandparentThumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vchp-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentTitle="Cuando Hay Pasión" grandparentType="show" index="2" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-11T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg" title="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 125: Betania se casa, Daniela enfurece" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 125: Betania se casa, Daniela enfurece" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 125: Betania se casa, Daniela enfurece" type="coverPoster" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vchp-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Cuando Hay Pasion - Episodio 125: Betania se casa, Daniela enfurece" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vchp-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1782097200" duration="3600000" endsAt="1782100800" id="6a2f48d0d504c6769a893f19" onAir="0" p